        "system": {
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>One pound of zero-value mundane trash from a Trash Bag, suitable for drawing an improvised object. Remove one unit for a one-handed object or three for a two-handed object. The object’s identity is random; resolve its improvised-weapon statistics separately. The bag regenerates two pounds every six hours, up to five pounds.</p>",
